ost office.So tell Mom and Dad that things are going well here--I'm recovering from jet-lag (I was sooooo dead when I got here) and I'll be travelling to paris next Monday.  Maybe I can find a cyber-bar there or something, at any rate, I'll send out some tulip postcards tomorrow :)How are you? and how is little Schpaaa-birdie?My poorlittle abandoned kitten...*sigh*I miss you, so write me some big long letter.Love,Mary**mikey**To: jimpaSubj: hiyaDate: Sep 17Hiya Jimpa!I'm still alive!!! Do you have e-mail?Mine is: mikey@abv.co.atGreetings and hugs to your sister!!ByeMikey :))**linsolent**To: jimpaRe:   umDate: Sep 17Cool, your back. Its so good to hear from you. Are you still thinking of comingdownunder? Yes I am still waiting for the letter. You're not getting one from meuntil it arrive either!Can u read your email? Is it the same address? If so email me at batroc@hotmail.combecause I can read that from work at the moment and mail you back because I am usuallybored.Well its good to see you are back. I spoke to one of your friends who told meyour computer was stuffed. I hope that all is spiffy for you and although I would love to write a long letter, I am not going to do it on HM. Just to let you knowI am still insane!LoveMe 2**daniella**To: jimpaRe:   MURDE DEAATH KILLDate: Sep 19unh!why didnt you go away on a racey trip?i have a paper due tomorrow, but i dont think i can get it done in timeim sure hell give me the weekend, since ive been crippledkashmir likes to sleep on my airwalks boxshes always curled up on itrobyn fell asleep watching dumboshes all dirty from daycareme go dolovedani**linsolent**To: jimpaSubj: MmmmmCc: **Date: Sep 19I would love to help but its a bit hard when I dont know what email clientyou are using. Hopefully might catch you on one day, but I only come around now.Will try to get on during the weekend, Sunday. Hey whats your phone number?**daniella**To: jimpa